  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Kansas City Star (Roger Miller)**: rare: 5 archived performances [3]\n- **Hawakawani Say**: mythic rare: 2 archived performances [3]\n- **I Don't Wanna Leave You On The Farm**: rare: 5 archived performances [3]\n- **Mountains & Buffalo**: rare: 7 archived performances [3]\n- **The Stallion, Pt. 4**: rare: 14 archived performances [3]\n- **Kite Flying Man**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **Deep Calm**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **Oh My Dear (I'm Falling In Love)**: back after 178 archived shows (2734 days); rare: 6 archived performances [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **ween2011-11-24.schoepsmk4** (recommended): source not stated; 26 songs; 103 min; rated 3/5 by 1 [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Jane Scarpantoni played cello with the band for most of the show [2]\n- The taper recorded from table 53, right next to Gener's mother [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **ween2011-11-24.schoepsmk4**: taped by larrysellers; transferred by larrysellers; source: Schoeps MK4 > nbox > pcm-m10 (24/48) [1]. Also: Recorded with Schoeps MK4 mics through nbox to pcm-m10 at 24/48, converted to 16/44 CD WAV, edited in Vegas Pro 10.0c, encoded to FLAC [1]",
